00110001 11001001 # instruction | XOR CX,CX | 31 C9 clears command length.
00110001 11000000 # instruction | XOR AX,AX | 31 C0 selects BIOS keyboard service zero.
11001101 00010110 # instruction | INT 16 | CD 16 waits for a real BIOS keyboard character.
00111100 00001101 # instruction | CMP AL,0D | 3C compares the character with carriage return.
01110100 00101111 # instruction | JE dispatch | 74 rel8; next offset 58 + 47 = 105.
00111100 00001000 # instruction | CMP AL,08 | 3C checks the backspace character.
01110100 00010100 # instruction | JE backspace | 74; next offset 62 + 20 = 82.
00111100 00100000 # instruction | CMP AL,20 | 3C rejects control characters below ASCII space.
01110010 11110000 # instruction | JB read | 72; next offset 66 minus 16 = 50.
